00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:35.860
The trade-off flips back inside that old 10 to 30 kilowatt band, where pumps and plates

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:40.200
add leak paths without extra accelerators the air system could already feed.

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:45.820
Once a deployment approaches one megawatt per rack, staying on air means leaving some of

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:50.680
